=== Hybrid RRF + HuggingFace Reranking via PostQueryEvent ===

This example demonstrates CombinedStore with RRF, followed by
cross-encoder reranking via a PostQueryEvent listener.

Query: "crime family mafia"

--- Hybrid RRF Results (no reranking) ---
  1. The Godfather (RRF Score: 0.016393)
  2. Reservoir Dogs (RRF Score: 0.016129)
  3. Kill Bill: Vol. 1 (RRF Score: 0.015873)
  4. The Matrix (RRF Score: 0.015625)
  5. Pulp Fiction (RRF Score: 0.015385)
  6. The Green Mile (RRF Score: 0.015152)
  7. Memento (RRF Score: 0.014925)
  8. The Shawshank Redemption (RRF Score: 0.014706)
  9. Apocalypse Now (RRF Score: 0.014493)
  10. Spirited Away (RRF Score: 0.014286)
  11. Gladiator (RRF Score: 0.014085)
  12. The Dark Knight (RRF Score: 0.013889)
  13. The Prestige (RRF Score: 0.013699)
  14. Notting Hill (RRF Score: 0.013514)
  15. Cloud Atlas (RRF Score: 0.013333)
  16. WALL-E (RRF Score: 0.013158)
  17. Inception (RRF Score: 0.012987)
  18. Project Hail Mary (RRF Score: 0.012821)
  19. Interstellar (RRF Score: 0.012658)
  20. Jurassic Park (RRF Score: 0.012500)

--- Hybrid RRF + HuggingFace Reranking Results ---
  1. The Godfather (Relevance: 0.0172)
  2. Reservoir Dogs (Relevance: 0.0172)
  3. Kill Bill: Vol. 1 (Relevance: 0.0172)
  4. The Matrix (Relevance: 0.0172)
  5. Pulp Fiction (Relevance: 0.0172)

=== Summary ===
- CombinedStore merges vector and text results using RRF scoring
- RerankerListener on PostQueryEvent refines results using a cross-encoder model
